      "previewText": "The chemotherapy drug cisplatin is found to break down in the body according to 1st order kinetics. The rate constant for this reaction at body temperature is 1.87×10-3 min-1.Starting with a cisplatin concentration in the body of @@initialConc@@×10-4 M:   What will the cisplatin concentration be after @@time@@.0 hours?  MHow long will it take for the cisplatin concentration to reach @@finalConc@@×10-4 M?  min  ",
      "targeted": [],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "children": [],
          "data": [
            {
              "children": [],
              "expression": "// Two variable definitions\nconst conc1Index = OLI.random(0, 4);\nconst conc1array = [5.00, 6.00, 7.00, 8.00, 9.00];\nconst initialConc = conc1array[conc1Index] .toFixed(2);\nconst conc2Index = OLI.random(0,3);\nconst conc2array = [1.00, 2.00, 3.00];\nconst finalConc = conc2array[conc2Index] .toFixed(2);\nconst initialConcCon = (initialConc/10000);\nconst finalConcCon = (finalConc/10000);\nconst time = OLI.random(11,18,0);\nconst timeMin = (time*60);\nconst logConc = Math.log(initialConcCon);\nconst step1 = (0.00187*timeMin*-1);\nconst step2 = (step1+logConc);\nconst step2Rnd = (step2) .toPrecision(5);\nconst correct1 = Math.pow(2.718, step2);\nconst cor1Rnd = (correct1) .toPrecision(3);\nconst cor1Low = correct1*0.98;\nconst cor1High = correct1*1.02;\nconst finalOverInitial = (finalConcCon/initialConcCon);\nconst logFinalOverInitial = Math.log(finalOverInitial);\nconst correct2 = (-534.759*logFinalOverInitial);\nconst cor2Rnd = (correct2) .toPrecision(3);\nconst cor2Low = (correct2*0.99);\nconst cor2High = (correct2*1.01);\n\n\n// Expose variables to OLI\nmodule.exports = {\n \n  initialConc,\n \n  finalConc,\n  initialConcCon,\n  finalConcCon,\n  time,\n  timeMin,\n  logConc,\n  step1,\n  step2,\n  step2Rnd,\n  correct1,\n  cor1Rnd,\n  cor1Low,\n  cor1High,\n  finalOverInitial,\n  logFinalOverInitial,\n  correct2,\n  cor2Rnd,\n  cor2Low,\n  cor2High\n};\n",
              "id": "de9fa498366749b6902836d1535c27f2",
